{#
The answer to an Undo.

A toast and nothing else. The rows that come back are not drawn from here: they
return to a sorted, paginated list whose counts they change, and the client
re-reads the list frame for that — see mail--status-undo.

Variables:
  restored  false when the token named nothing any more, which is said rather
            than passed off as success
#}
{% if restored %}
    {% include '_partials/_toast.stream.html.twig' with { message: 'toast.undone'|trans } only %}
{% else %}
    {% include '_partials/_toast.stream.html.twig' with { message: 'toast.undo_expired'|trans, type: 'info' } only %}
{% endif %}
